### 公开署名与验证分离 / Attribution versus validation

中文：作者、代码维护者、历史研究记录生产者和独立复核者不是同一身份，GitHub 署名及软件 DOI 不自动认证图状态正确、持久记忆或外部复现

English: Author, maintainer, historical research producer and independent verifier are distinct identities. GitHub attribution and software DOI do not certify graph correctness, persistent memory or external reproduction

